 232:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 			 *        this function). To statically set the USB options, pass in the \c USE_STATIC_OPTIONS t
